```

Key differences from Option A:
- `.skeleton-card` is a standalone class for card skeleton, not tied to `.gci` structure
- Shimmer direction is `-200% → 200%` (left-to-right sweep) instead of `200% → -200%`
- Uses `#e8e8e8` / `#f5f5f5` light gray colors instead of theme-colored transparent sweep
```css
